{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sweetie Candy Maze: Pink Raspberry \u2014 is a colorful and fun maze game set in a world of juicy pink raspberry candies and sweet surprises. Collect all the sweets and find your way to the caramel portal to complete each level.<br><br>Each new maze brings more challenge and excitement as you explore deeper into the candy world!<br><br>In Sweetie Candy Maze: Pink Raspberry:<br><br>\u2022 50 levels of candy-filled fun<br>\u2022 Bright and tasty visuals<br>\u2022 Gradually increasing difficulty<br>\u2022 Addictive and cheerful gameplay<br>\u2022 Relaxing music<br>\u2022 Achievements<br>\u2022 Simple controls<br><br>Use Gamepads (Xbox One or Xbox 360), or keyboard (WASD or arrow keys) to navigate through the different mazes!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097890/extras/5b14c9f2cd29256411facb8782a5f64b.poster.avif?t=1761724641\" width=75 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097890/extras/5b14c9f2cd29256411facb8782a5f64b.webm?t=1761724641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097890/extras/b7d3e4e08b944b81651bdf95ce56f51f.poster.avif?t=1761724641\" width=74 height=68 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097890/extras/b7d3e4e08b944b81651bdf95ce56f51f.webm?t=1761724641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097890/extras/547a9059fe6acf38e43ae668dcd382ee.poster.avif?t=1761724641\" wid